    "index.copy.075"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.neon-card-desc",
   "text": "The purpose of this experiment was to test the fidelity and material realism of the HiDream diffusion model using ComfyUI. The core objective was to build a tailored local pipeline capable of rendering intricate, organic structures.",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.076"
   ]
  },
