   "text": "Midjourney",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.084"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.hud-panel-num",
   "text": "[ MIDJOURNEY INC. ]",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.085"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.hud-spec-label",
   "text": "// Potential use cases",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.086"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.hud-spec-val",
   "text": "Generating high-quality concept art, storyboards for videos and detailed textures for design projects.",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.087"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.font-mono.text-accent",
   "text": "// vnon",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.088"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2.text-4xl.font-bold",
   "text": "Liquid Drum & Bass.",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.089"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.text-lg.text-gray-400",
   "text": "I have been making music on and off as a hobby since 2020, using it as a vital creative outlet. From the beginning, I found myself gravitating towards Liquid Drum & Bass, drawn by the sheer diversity of DnB as a genre, which has kept my focus ever since.",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.090"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.text-lg.text-gray-400",
   "text": "My workflow relies heavily on sampling from other tracks and moulding them to fit my signature sound. I see working with samples as akin to collaging, a tactile, layered art form I loved experimenting with during the early stages of my visual arts practice.",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.091"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "a.btn-primary",
   "text": "Explore_My_Music",
   "_src": [
    "index.copy.092"
   ]
